  "title": "Mini Chocolate Chip Shortbread",
  "description": "This mini chocolate chip shortbread has a wonderful buttery taste and is totally plant based. Make sure to use vegan chocolate chips if you want the shortbread to be entirely plant based.",
  "authors": [
    "Becel"
  ],
  "date_published": "2021-05-05T18:31:26-04:00",
